# Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored) for `npx wrangler dev`. Cloudflare's always-pass Turnstile test secret: with the
# test site key in src/data/public-keys.js, the dummy response XXXX.DUMMY.TOKEN.XXXX verifies (as hostname
# example.com, with no action), so Ask runs end to end locally. SESSION_KEY here signs local Ask tokens only. With no
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY Ask answers 'off'; docs/WORKER.md says how to run it with the key. Real secrets: put-secret.mjs.
TURNSTILE_SECRET=1x0000000000000000000000000000000AA
TURNSTILE_HOSTNAMES=example.com
SESSION_KEY=local-only-signing-key
